---
import data from '../../data/jobs.json';
---
<section id="jobs" class="section experience-section">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Experience</p><h2>Different teams.<br />A shared way of working.</h2></div></div>
  <p class="experience-note">Several startup roles overlapped. These are distinct product and employment identities, rather than a sequence of unrelated full-time jobs.</p>
  <ol class="experience-list">{data.jobs.map(job => <li><div class="job-heading"><h3>{job.company}</h3><span>{job.start} — {job.end}</span></div><div><p class="job-role">{job.role}</p><p>{job.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol>
</section>
